title: "A-TRFu: advanced trust-region funnel method for grey-box optimisation"
abstract: "The A-TRFu solver (hypervolume sampling-region management and feasibility restoration for grey-box problems with several truth models) and the scripts and reference results that reproduce Chapter 7 of the PhD thesis “Rigorous Trust-Region Algorithms for Surrogate-based Grey-box Optimisation” (Tables 7.1-7.5, Figures 7.3 and 7.5)."
